# Midnight Club 3: DUB Edition (54540079), Nova, RETURNING: an MC3 profile
# is on the disk. DRAFT by lane.routeprep, 2026-09-26, not played.
#
# Evidence: as mc3.first-run.route (boot and title timing only, from
# titlebench-19's hands-off frames). Everything past the title is [guess]:
# the profile list with the saved profile highlighted, then the same
# Arcade -> Cruise path.
wait 60
shot boot60
press START                 # [guess] try to skip the intro FMV
wait 30
shot boot90
wait 25
shot boot115                # expect "PRESS START TO BEGIN" [seen f12]
mark booted
press START
wait 8
shot profiles               # [guess] the saved profile highlighted, or an autoload notice
press A
wait 8
shot loaded
press A                     # [guess] dismiss a "load successful"; OPEN: if this lands in Career, press B
wait 6
mark profile-loaded
shot main-menu
axis LY max                 # [guess] down: Arcade
wait 0.15
axis LY mid
wait 0.6
shot on-arcade
press A
wait 6
shot arcade-menu
press A
wait 6
shot city
press A
wait 6
shot car
press A
wait 6
shot confirm
press A
wait 30
shot loading
wait 10
shot drive
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder
repeat forever {
    axis RT max
    axis LX min
    wait 1.5
    axis LX max
    wait 1.5
    axis LX mid
    wait 4
}
